  "body": "Found while working #869 (Air coolant mode). An operation's coolant (`Off` / `Flood` / `Mist` / `Air` / `Through tool`) is set in the GUI through the undoable `EditOperationParams::with_coolant` (`CommandKind::EditOperationCoolant`), but no MCP tool or script verb reaches it. A headless agent cannot ask for air on a Carvera, or for Off on a dry cut.\n\n**Done means:**\n- an MCP tool (e.g. `set_operation_coolant { name, coolant: \"off\" | \"flood\" | \"mist\" | \"air\" | \"through-tool\" }`) that runs the same undoable command, so undo/redo hold headlessly;\n- an unknown word is refused by name;\n- the camcraft-mcp skill's tool table lists it;\n- pinned by a test that sets Air through MCP and undoes it.\n",
